WEBVTT

00:30:59.246 --> 00:31:03.704
I was the same age when she died as she
was when she was pregnant with me.

00:31:04.246 --> 00:31:09.079
So I lost her at the same age that I
that I came into her life. Right.

00:31:09.246 --> 00:31:13.121
You know, I wish that I wish that I didn't
have to go into the darkness.

00:31:13.121 --> 00:31:17.371
But, you know, I was always trying
to move in the direction of love.

00:31:17.371 --> 00:31:19.996
And I felt so alone in my grief.

00:31:20.538 --> 00:31:24.038
And then when I wrote about it and told
the truth about it, how savage it was,

00:31:24.038 --> 00:31:26.663
I felt like, OK, everyone's
going to think I'm crazy.

00:31:27.246 --> 00:31:32.163
But instead, what everyone thought
was me too to this day, you know,